d 'ITDIDBOUNDS': module to compute timing-uncertainty envelopes for interval-timed difference-in-differences contrasts
d
d  itdidbounds computes numerical timing-uncertainty envelopes for
d difference-in-differences/event-time contrasts when treatment
d adoption timing is known only to lie within unit-specific
d intervals. The command enumerates feasible adoption dates and
d reports the minimum and maximum contrast estimates across those
d timing assignments. These envelopes characterize sensitivity to
d interval-known treatment timing; they are not automatically
d causal treatment-effect bounds or confidence intervals. 
d
d KW: difference-in-difference
d KW: DID
d KW: event time
d KW: bunds
d
d Requires: Stata version 
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260915
d
d Author:  Christina Laternser ,  Ann & Robert H. Lurie Children’s Hospital of Chicago
d Support: email christina.laternser.research@@gmail.com
d
f itdidbounds.ado
f itdidbounds.sthlp
f itdidbounds_demo.do
